{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:93E101B6AB4E",
  "root": "u2",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 129,
      "text": "Some schools offer distance learning as an option for students to attend classes from home by using online or video conferencing.",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 130,
      "end": 205,
      "text": "I think some students would benefit from this and other students would not.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 207,
      "end": 254,
      "text": "I believe some students could benefit from this",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 255,
      "end": 366,
      "text": "because they could do work whenever they want, They also don't have to wake up early everyday and go to school.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 367,
      "end": 401,
      "text": "If they have things to do at home,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "start": 402,
      "end": 455,
      "text": "they can do that and still have time for school work.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 456,
      "end": 517,
      "text": "I also believe that some students would not benefit off this.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 519,
      "end": 568,
      "text": "I dont think all students would do good with this",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 569,
      "end": 610,
      "text": "because not everyone learns the same way.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 611,
      "end": 653,
      "text": "For example, some students learn visually.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 654,
      "end": 697,
      "text": "Not all students have a peaceful household,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "start": 698,
      "end": 751,
      "text": "which makes it harder to pay attention to their work.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 752,
      "end": 834,
      "text": "Students can also have learning disabilities which can make it difficult to learn.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u14",
      "start": 836,
      "end": 896,
      "text": "In my opinion, it really just depends on who the student is.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 897,
      "end": 941,
      "text": "Maybe distance learning is not for everyone.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
